          %p
            Notice that the
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/volume"} volume
            of the
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/hyperbolic+solid+torus"} hyperbolic solid torus
            is
            = succeed "." do
              %em
                not
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/finite+number"} finite
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/hyperbolic+3-manifold"} hyperbolic 3-manifold
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/knot+complement"} knot complement
            does not count as a “knot complement with hyperbolic structure” in the sense of
            = succeed "\u2018s" do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/William+Thurston"} Thurston
            %span.newWikiWord
              classification of 3-manifolds
